var documenterSearchIndex = {"docs":
[{"location":"raw_data/#Raw-Data-Workflow","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Raw Data Workflow","text":"This page describes how to generate and update files under data/raw/ using:\n\nscripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl\nscripts/02_download_caid_data.jl\nscripts/03_download_sifts.jl\n\nRun commands from the repository root.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Prerequisites","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Prerequisites","text":"Julia installed.\nNetwork access to:\nhttps://disprot.org\nhttps://caid.idpcentral.org\nhttps://ftp.ebi.ac.uk\n\nBoth scripts activate and instantiate scripts/Project.toml automatically.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Generate-Or-Update-Raw-Data","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Generate Or Update Raw Data","text":"Run the scripts in this order:\n\njulia scripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl\njulia scripts/02_download_caid_data.jl\njulia scripts/03_download_sifts.jl","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Optional-CLI-Arguments","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Optional CLI Arguments","text":"DisProt download script (01):\n\njulia scripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl --release 2025_12 --idpo_version 0.3.0\n\n--release: DisProt release identifier.\n--idpo_version: IDPO version identifier.\n\nCAID download script (02):\n\njulia scripts/02_download_caid_data.jl --raw_data_dir data/raw\n\n--raw_data_dir: target root for CAID output folders.\n\nSIFTS download script (03):\n\njulia scripts/03_download_sifts.jl --raw_data_dir data/raw\n\n--raw_data_dir: target root for the SIFTS output folder.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Expected-Output-Layout","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Expected Output Layout","text":"After a successful run:\n\ndata/raw/\n|- disprot/\n|  |- README.md\n|  |- disprot_regions.json.gz\n|  |- idpo.json.gz\n|  `- mapping_ontology.tsv.gz\n|- caid_2/\n|  |- README.md\n|  `- *.fasta.gz\n|- caid_3/\n|  |- README.md\n|  `- *.fasta.gz\n`- sifts/\n   |- README.md\n   |- pdb_chain_uniprot.csv.gz\n   `- pdb_chain_cath_uniprot.csv.gz","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Notes","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Notes","text":"01_download_disprot_data.jl rewrites DisProt files inside data/raw/disprot/.\n02_download_caid_data.jl rewrites CAID files inside data/raw/caid_2/ and data/raw/caid_3/.\n03_download_sifts.jl rewrites SIFTS files inside data/raw/sifts/.\nIf a transient network error occurs, rerun the affected script.","category":"section"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset","text":"Documentation for IDRBindingDataset.\n\n","category":"section"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!-Tuple{AbstractDict, AbstractDict, AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!","text":"_append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!(\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    pdb_codes;\n    holding_status_fetcher\n)\n\nFor pdb_codes with missing release date, fetch holdings statuses (if not already present) and merge them into missing_release_pdb_status.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._append_replacement_rows!-Tuple{Vector{NamedTuple}, DataFrames.DataFrame, AbstractDict, AbstractDict, NamedTuple}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._append_replacement_rows!","text":"_append_replacement_rows!(\n    rows,\n    disprot_pdb_map,\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    default_pdb_status\n)\n\nAppend one row per replacement PDB for obsolete entries, preserving the source UniProt accession. A replacement row is only added when (acc, replacement_pdb) is not already present.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._attempt_download-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, Function, Function, Bool}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._attempt_download","text":"_attempt_download(url, destination, downloader, logger, log_success)\n\nRun a single atomic download attempt into destination.\n\nThe payload is first downloaded into a temporary file in the destination folder and only moved into place on success.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_invalid_merged_pdb_references-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_invalid_merged_pdb_references","text":"_build_invalid_merged_pdb_references(merged_pdb_references, cleaned_merged_pdb_rows)\n\nBuild a table of raw references that contain no extractable canonical PDB ID. This reuses already-expanded cleaned rows to avoid re-running regex extraction.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_pdb_release_map_row-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractDict, AbstractDict, NamedTuple}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_pdb_release_map_row","text":"_build_pdb_release_map_row(\n    acc,\n    pdb,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    default_pdb_status\n)\n\nBuild one annotated (acc, pdb) output row with release-date and holdings-status metadata.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._bytes_to_mb-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._bytes_to_mb","text":"_bytes_to_mb(bytes)\n\nConvert bytes to decimal megabytes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._caid_fasta_prefix_validator-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._caid_fasta_prefix_validator","text":"_caid_fasta_prefix_validator(path)\n\nValidate that a downloaded CAID FASTA file starts with >DP.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._default_rcsb_status_get_request-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._default_rcsb_status_get_request","text":"_default_rcsb_status_get_request(url)\n\nRun one holdings-status GET request without throwing on non-2xx statuses.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._download_caid_dataset-Tuple{Any, AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._download_caid_dataset","text":"_download_caid_dataset(dataset, raw_data_dir, timestamp_utc; logger = println)\n\nDownload one CAID dataset into its folder, validate raw FASTA headers, gzip files, and write a per-folder README.md.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._download_sifts_summary_file-Tuple{Type{<:MIToS.SIFTS.DataBase}, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._download_sifts_summary_file","text":"_download_sifts_summary_file(database, folder_path; logger = println)\n\nDownload one SIFTS summary file into folder_path and return its metadata.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._expand_merged_pdb_references-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._expand_merged_pdb_references","text":"_expand_merged_pdb_references(merged_pdb_references)\n\nExpand raw merged references to one row per extracted canonical PDB ID using DataFrames row-wise transformations.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._expanded_reference_rows-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._expanded_reference_rows","text":"_expanded_reference_rows(acc, pdb_reference)\n\nReturn cleaned PDB rows extracted from one raw (acc, pdb_reference) pair.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._extract_release_dates_from_response-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._extract_release_dates_from_response","text":"_extract_release_dates_from_response(response_body, batch_ids)\n\nParse one GraphQL response and return a dictionary from PDB ID to release date. Missing or unknown IDs are represented with missing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._format_mb-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._format_mb","text":"_format_mb(bytes)\n\nConvert bytes to decimal megabytes and round to 4 decimal digits.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries","text":"_get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries(pdb_id; max_retries, base_sleep, get_request, sleeper)\n\nFetch one holdings-status response for pdb_id, retrying on transient failures and HTTP 429 responses.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._markdown_value-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._markdown_value","text":"_markdown_value(value)\n\nRender one value for README markdown output, using missing for absent values.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._missing_release_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}, AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._missing_release_pdb_codes","text":"_missing_release_pdb_codes(pdb_codes, pdb_release_dates)\n\nReturn canonical PDB IDs with missing release-date records.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_string-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_string","text":"_normalize_optional_string(value; uppercase_output = false)\n\nNormalize an optional JSON field into Union{Missing,String}.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_ids-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_ids","text":"_normalize_pdb_ids(pdb_ids)\n\nNormalize PDB identifiers by trimming whitespace and converting to uppercase.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_holding_status_response-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_holding_status_response","text":"_parse_holding_status_response(response)\n\nParse one RCSB holdings status response into a typed status tuple.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_release_date-Tuple{Any, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_release_date","text":"_parse_release_date(raw_date, pdb_id)\n\nParse an RCSB initial_release_date value into Date. Returns missing when the API explicitly reports a missing date.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries","text":"_post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries(body; max_retries, base_sleep, post_request, sleeper)\n\nPOST one GraphQL payload to RCSB with bounded retries.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_disprot_entries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_disprot_entries","text":"_read_disprot_entries(disprot_regions_path)\n\nRead a DisProt compressed JSON regions file and return the data entries array.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_sifts_uniprot_df-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_sifts_uniprot_df","text":"_read_sifts_uniprot_df(sifts_uniprot_path)\n\nRead the SIFTS UniProt summary file and return it as a DataFrame.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._replacement_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._replacement_pdb_codes","text":"_replacement_pdb_codes(missing_release_pdb_status)\n\nReturn unique replacement PDB IDs extracted from holdings-status records.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._request_with_retries-Tuple{Function}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._request_with_retries","text":"_request_with_retries(\n    request_fn;\n    max_retries,\n    base_sleep,\n    sleeper,\n    is_success_response,\n    failure_prefix\n)\n\nRun one HTTP request with bounded retries and shared backoff logic.\n\nRetries on non-success responses and exceptions.\nUses Retry-After when HTTP status is 429.\nEmits consistent terminal errors containing last status and last exception.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_after_seconds-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response, Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_after_seconds","text":"_retry_after_seconds(response, base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn the wait duration for an HTTP 429 response. If Retry-After is not present or cannot be parsed, this falls back to exponential backoff.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_last_status_message-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_last_status_message","text":"_retry_last_status_message(last_status)\n\nRender the terminal HTTP-status message for retry-failure errors.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception-Tuple{Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception","text":"_retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception(base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn retry sleep duration for one transport/connection exception.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_status-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response, Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_status","text":"_retry_sleep_seconds_for_status(response, base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn retry sleep duration for one non-success HTTP response.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._sifts_mapping_description-Tuple{Type{<:MIToS.SIFTS.DataBase}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._sifts_mapping_description","text":"_sifts_mapping_description(database)\n\nReturn a human-readable mapping description for one SIFTS summary database.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._write_caid_folder_readme-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractString, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._write_caid_folder_readme","text":"_write_caid_folder_readme(folder_path, challenge, timestamp_utc, entries)\n\nWrite README.md metadata for a CAID raw-data folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._write_sifts_folder_readme-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._write_sifts_folder_readme","text":"_write_sifts_folder_readme(folder_path, timestamp_utc, entries)\n\nWrite README.md metadata for a SIFTS raw-data folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_regions_url-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_regions_url","text":"build_disprot_regions_url(release)\n\nBuild the DisProt API URL for retrieving all entries of a release, including ambiguous regions and excluding obsolete ones.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison","text":"build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison(disprot_uniprot_pdb_map, sifts_uniprot_pdb_map)\n\nOuter-join DisProt and SIFTS UniProt-PDB maps and add mapping_status labels:\n\nboth\nonly_disprot\nonly_sifts\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison","text":"build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison(\n    disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    release_date_fetcher = fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates,\n    holding_status_fetcher = fetch_pdb_holding_statuses\n)\n\nBuild cleaned UniProt-PDB tables and release-date/status annotations starting from a merged DisProt/SIFTS comparison table.\n\nReturns a named tuple containing intermediate and final tables, including:\n\ndisprot_pdb_map_with_release\nfailed_pdb_lookups\ninvalid_merged_pdb_references\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_raw-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_raw","text":"build_pdb_release_map_from_raw(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    release_date_fetcher = fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates,\n    holding_status_fetcher = fetch_pdb_holding_statuses\n)\n\nBuild the full UniProt-PDB release-date dataset from repository raw inputs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot","text":"build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot(sifts_uniprot_df, disprot_uniprot_ids)\n\nBuild a unique SIFTS UniProt-PDB map restricted to DisProt UniProt IDs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map","text":"build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map(region_level_pdb_refs)\n\nCollapse region-level references into one row per unique (acc, pdb) pair.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.classify_pdb_lookup_status-Tuple{Union{Missing, Dates.Date}, NamedTuple{(:http_status, :status, :status_code, :replacement_pdb)}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.classify_pdb_lookup_status","text":"classify_pdb_lookup_status(release_date, holding_status)\n\nClassify one PDB lookup result into one of:\n\ncurrent\nobsolete\ninvalid_or_not_found\ncurrent_without_release_date\nunresolved\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.clean_directory-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.clean_directory","text":"clean_directory(path)\n\nRemove path recursively if it exists, then recreate it as an empty directory.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs","text":"collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs(disprot_entries)\n\nCollect region-level DisProt PDB cross references into a tidy table with columns:\n\nacc\npdb\npdb_reference (raw cross-reference value)\n\nPDB IDs are cleaned using extract_pdb_codes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_caid_reference_data-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_caid_reference_data","text":"download_caid_reference_data(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    timestamp_utc = utc_now_iso8601(),\n    logger = println,\n    datasets = CAID_DATASETS\n)\n\nDownload CAID-2 and CAID-3 reference FASTA files into raw_data_dir, regenerate their folder READMEs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_sifts_reference_data-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_sifts_reference_data","text":"download_sifts_reference_data(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    timestamp_utc = utc_now_iso8601(),\n    logger = println\n)\n\nDownload SIFTS chain-level summary CSV files for UniProt and CATH into joinpath(raw_data_dir, \"sifts\"), preserving gzip compression and regenerating the folder README.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_to_file_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_to_file_with_retries","text":"download_to_file_with_retries(url, destination;\n    delays = ExponentialBackOff(n = 5), downloader = Downloads.download,\n    logger = println, log_success = true)\n\nDownload url into destination using atomic writes and bounded retries. If all attempts fail, the last exception is rethrown.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_to_gzip_file_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_to_gzip_file_with_retries","text":"download_to_gzip_file_with_retries(url, destination;\n    delays = ExponentialBackOff(n = 5), downloader = Downloads.download,\n    logger = println, precompress_validator = nothing)\n\nDownload url, compress it as gzip, and save it to destination.\n\nIf precompress_validator is provided, it is called with the path to the downloaded temporary uncompressed file before compression starts.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.ensure_files_within_size_limit-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.ensure_files_within_size_limit","text":"ensure_files_within_size_limit(paths; max_bytes, limit_name, remediation)\n\nValidate that all files in paths exist and are smaller than or equal to max_bytes.\n\nIf any file is missing or exceeds the configured limit, this function throws an ErrorException with a clear multi-line diagnostic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.extract_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.extract_pdb_codes","text":"extract_pdb_codes(reference)\n\nExtract canonical 4-character PDB identifiers from one raw reference string.\n\nAccepted patterns include raw IDs (1ABC), IDs with chain suffixes (1ABC:A, 1ABC_A), prefixed IDs (PDB:1ABC), and concatenated strings where IDs are token-delimited (for example 1ABC;PDB:2DEF).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_holding_statuses-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_holding_statuses","text":"fetch_pdb_holding_statuses(\n    pdb_ids;\n    max_retries = 5,\n    base_sleep = 0.5\n)\n\nFetch RCSB holdings status records for canonical 4-character PDB IDs.\n\nReturns Dict{String,PDBHoldingStatus} keyed by uppercase PDB ID.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates","text":"fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates(\n    pdb_ids;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    max_retries = 5,\n    base_sleep = 0.5\n)\n\nFetch initial PDB release dates from the RCSB GraphQL API for pdb_ids.\n\nReturns Dict{String,Union{Missing,Date}} keyed by normalized uppercase PDB ID. Any unknown ID is included with value missing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.parse_disprot_release-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.parse_disprot_release","text":"parse_disprot_release(release)\n\nParse a DisProt release tag in YYYY_MM format into a Date at the first day of that month.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.remove_files-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.remove_files","text":"remove_files(paths)\n\nRemove each file path in paths if it exists. Parent directories are kept.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.utc_now_iso8601-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.utc_now_iso8601","text":"utc_now_iso8601(; clock = () -> now(UTC))\n\nReturn the current UTC timestamp as yyyy-mm-ddTHH:MM:SSZ.\n\nThe clock keyword is injectable to make tests deterministic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_download_report-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_download_report","text":"write_download_report(report_path; status, timestamp_utc, release, idpo_version,\n    sources, error_message = nothing)\n\nWrite a Markdown report describing the last raw-data download run.\n\nsources must be an iterable of (url, filename) pairs where each filename is expected to live in dirname(report_path).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz","text":"write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz(disprot_pdb_map_with_release, output_path)\n\nWrite disprot_pdb_map_with_release as compressed CSV to output_path.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_readme-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_readme","text":"write_pdb_release_readme(\n    readme_path;\n    output_csv_path,\n    disprot_pdb_map_with_release,\n    failed_pdb_lookups,\n    invalid_merged_pdb_references,\n    batch_size,\n    generated_at_utc = utc_now_iso8601()\n)\n\nWrite a README report for the derived PDB release-date dataset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"}]
}
